      "machineHash": "fd396fbf76a12f361afd520e8f3b684552bd33b313cc1e84ef986e9e4f4db150",
      "machineText": "`app.Autostart`會註冊您的應用程式，使其在使用者登入時自動啟動。它會為各平台選用適當的原生機制，並解析使用符號連結的安裝路徑（Homebrew、Scoop），避免二進位檔升級後註冊失效。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "`app.Autostart` registers your application to launch automatically when the user logs in. It picks t…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
